ulia Trevelyan Oman’s period designs.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-12-01\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":140,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015496\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018982\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018983\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"6141\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"6144\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000028\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"bf98f859-895c-4c38-8fb5-ff31eab7f8da\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008947\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010094\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing Ltd\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000015496\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"James\",\"familyName\":\"Hay\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000018982\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Marianna\",\"familyName\":\"Tsembenhoi\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000018983\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Taisuke\",\"familyName\":\"Nakao\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"6141\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Reece\",\"familyName\":\"Clarke\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"6144\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Mayara\",\"familyName\":\"Magri\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000028\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Ballet\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"0000000010\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"TBC\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"To be confirmed\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[{\"id\":\"0000000011\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\